cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite this release."
title: "Projector-Resolved Seed Calculus II: Polyphase Refinement, Weighted Transfer, and Dyadic-Odd Resolution"
type: article
authors:
  - given-names: Komorebi
    family-names: P.
version: 1.2.1
date-released: 2026-09-03
abstract: >-
  A scope-explicit treatment of coherent packet refinement, residue and
  finite-table Fourier selectors, dyadic-odd coordinates, pruned weighted
  transfer inversion, determinant-rational finite walk series, integral
  separation, concrete ZMod Smith-coordinate fibres, and typed linear defects,
  with a Lean 4 formal contract and Python companion. The general DVR Smith
  extension is certificate-explicit.
